      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Ayo, what if Clancy fuckin' me over?",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "What if \"Who Dat Boy\" is rhetorical and this shit is over?",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "What if I'm hustling backwards?",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "What if my accountant ain't payin' my taxes, fillin' his pockets?",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And IRS show up asking me questions I couldn't answer",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "'Cause I was too busy tryna make classics",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "(Boy ain't got no motherfucking classics)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "What if my music too weird for the masses?",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And I'm only known for tweets more than beats or",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "All my day-ones turn to three, fours 'cause of track seven",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Fuck, what if I get stuck?",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "What if I got comfortable? I gotta keep it buck-fifty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "What if I lost it all and ended up back in Ladera",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "At them shitty apartments that's across from Bank of America?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Damn, I would be hurtin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Writing all of these songs 'cause Wi-Fi wasn't working (Nah)",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Last year, in total, I put out two verses",
          "rhyme": "ERs",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "But five-seven figures since then, life's kinda perfect",
          "rhyme": "Ekt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Oh, is it really? Oh, is it really? Bitch, you know the dealy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Really hilly willy tilly silly, hold that billy, how I Milly Rock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "When they can't relate him, when they start to hate him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "They don't drive these cars, so what's their ultimatum?",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Tell me, what's your November? Is it a person?",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Mine was the summer, '06, I remember the... (*Horn*)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "What if I thought the brake was the gas? What if I crashed?",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "What if these deep thoughts was my last? Let me pull over, quick",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        }
      ],
