      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "My November was those Odd Future Sundays, where we used to just skate all day",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "My November, and I was performing and Lil Wayne rapped with me, I think I cried that night",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "My November was awesome, I booked my first feature film",
          "rhyme": "ilm",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "My November was when I was gifted this Getz and Gilberto album",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "My November was seeing Erykah Badu perform",
          "rhyme": "uRm",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "My November was... my brother took me to my first concert ever, which was to Kanye West's \"Glow in the Dark Tour\"",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "My November was summer 2015 when I fell in love with someone who fucked my whole world up, showed me life through a different",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "2014, Miami 43rd Street, every day was November",
